    {
      "type": "sentences",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Why did Mubarak cancel the meeting?"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "(The) Palestinians and (the) Israelis must act."
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Why wasn't Powell's mission successful?"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Why couldn't he persuade the Israelis?"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "When did Israelis end their military offensive against Palestinian lands?"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "What are insiders saying about the success of Powell's trip?"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "It's not about you."
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "He has to send it to the judge."
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "What does it say?"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "Do you really want to read it?"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "My father was an alcoholic."
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "Does he wear his rings?"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "Why did you break up with her?"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "It's not your fault, is it?"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "Arabs and Israelis must make a choice."
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "He addressed cadets."
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "The responsibility for peace lies with Israel."
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "Israel must continue its withdrawals."
        }
      ]
